        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-375 (ensure controlled execution — Product Category &amp; Shopper Research (PA-44.3).) | - operational: Category Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Category Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
