    <bpmn:process id="W_W1925" name="W1925. Consumer Trend &amp; Emerging Product Category Monitoring" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly trend monitoring; major trend identification
Frequency: Monthly monitoring; quarterly trend report
Volume: Philippine and global home improvement trends
Owner: Market Research Analyst
Participants: Market Research Analyst, VP Merchandising, Category Manager
Source: workflow W1925 — Consumer Trend &amp; Emerging Product Category Monitoring</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1925_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1925_Lane1" name="Market Research Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1925_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1925_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1925_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1925_Lane2" name="VP Merchandising">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1925_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1925_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1925_Start4" name="Monthly trend monitoring; major trend identification">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1925_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1925_Task5" name="Market Research Analyst monitors consumer trends: (a) global home improvement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Market Research Analyst monitors consumer trends: (a) global home improvement trends: smart home devices, energy-efficient products, sustainable materials, modular construction, DIY home automation, (b) Philippine-specific trends: condo renovation (small-space solutions), typhoon-resilient construction materials, solar energy adoption, electric vehicle charging installation, water storage and purification, (c) social media trend monitoring: home improvement content on Filipino social media (YouTube renovation channels, TikTok DIY creators, Facebook home improvement groups), (d) international trade shows: coverage of major events (International Builders&#x27; Show, BAU Munich, philconstruct)
Responsible (R): Market Research Analyst
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Ongoing (2–3 hours/week)</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1925_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1925_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1925_Task6" name="Quarterly: Market Research Analyst presents trend report: (a) top 5 emerging…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Quarterly: Market Research Analyst presents trend report: (a) top 5 emerging trends relevant to BuildRight, (b) assessment: is this trend applicable to Philippine market? What is the likely adoption timeline?, (c) recommendation: should BuildRight pilot these products/categories?, (d) if yes: Category Manager initiates viability study per W1919
Responsible (R): Market Research Analyst
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: 1 day/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1925_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1925_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1925_Task7" name="Annual: VP Merchandising incorporates trend outlook into category strategy: (a)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Annual: VP Merchandising incorporates trend outlook into category strategy: (a) identify categories for investment (growing trends), (b) identify categories for divestment (declining trends), (c) pilot new product categories aligned with emerging trends
Responsible (R): VP Merchandising
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: 1 day/year</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1925_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1925_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1925_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
