        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-375 (ensure controlled execution — Product Category &amp; Shopper Research (PA-44.3).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Market Research Analyst</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
